    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85440" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-τόκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bearing more than one
				child,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
				30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bringing forth many children</i> or <i>young ones, prolific,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				688a34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				749b31
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.14
			</span></i>.</div>
